# Merged from the two package .gitignores when apps/desktop and apps/server
# moved under this root. One file covers both workspaces — keep it that way
# rather than reintroducing per-package files that drift apart.
#
# Note on anchoring: a pattern matches at any depth only when it contains NO
# slash at all (`node_modules`). As soon as a pattern contains a slash anywhere
# it is anchored to this directory, so `resources/vscode-server/` would only
# match at the repo root and miss `apps/desktop/resources/vscode-server/`.
# Multi-segment patterns therefore need an explicit `**/` prefix.

# ── Dependencies and build output ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
dist
out
*.tsbuildinfo
electron.vite.config.*.mjs

# apps/server — Prisma client is generated, never committed
/apps/server/generated/prisma

# ── Large downloaded artifacts (apps/desktop) ────────────────────────────────
# The VS Code web server is fetched by scripts/download-vscode-server.sh
# (~670 MB) on the first `npm run dev`. Never commit it.
**/resources/vscode-server/

# ── Local machine noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.eslintcache
*.log*
.claude/

# ── Raw media ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Screen recordings are tens of megabytes each. Only the final compressed GIF or
# PNG belongs in docs/assets/ — keep the source recordings outside the repo.
*.mov
*.mp4

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Per-workspace agent context ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Braid writes workspace.local.md into the artifact directory and into each
# agent's rules directory. It names local paths, so it is never committed.
# `.tracigo/` is the pre-rename artifact directory name; branches created by an
# older release still carry it, so both names stay ignored.
**/.braid/workspace.local.md
**/.tracigo/workspace.local.md
**/.claude/rules/workspace.local.md
**/.github/instructions/workspace.local.md
**/.cursor/rules/workspace.local.md
**/.clinerules/workspace.local.md
**/.kiro/steering/workspace.local.md
